{"PageNumber":7,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":2,"SurahIndex":"002","VerseNumber":38,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قُلۡنَا ٱهۡبِطُواْ مِنۡهَا جَمِيعٗاۖ فَإِمَّا يَأۡتِيَنَّكُم مِّنِّي هُدٗى فَمَن تَبِعَ هُدَايَ فَلَا خَوۡفٌ عَلَيۡهِمۡ وَلَا هُمۡ يَحۡزَنُونَ","TajweedText":"قُلْنَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>هْبِطُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> مِنْهَا جَمِي<tajweed class=ikhafa>عًا‌ۖ ف</tajweed>َإِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا يَأْتِيَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َك<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ِّ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>ِى هُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>دًى ف</tajweed>َمَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ت</tajweed>َبِعَ هُدَاىَ فَلَا خَوْفٌ عَلَيْهِمْ وَلَا هُمْ يَحْزَن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٨</span>","End":"٣٨","PageNumber":7,"JuzNumber":1,"ManzilNumber":1,"RukuNumber":5,"MaqraNumber":2,"HizbNumber":1,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":2,"SurahIndex":"002","VerseNumber":39,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُواْ وَكَذَّبُواْ بِـَٔايَٰتِنَآ أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ أَصۡحَٰبُ ٱلنَّارِۖ هُمۡ فِيهَا خَٰلِدُونَ","TajweedText":"وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> وَكَذَّبُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> بِـَٔـايَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>تِن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أُ<tajweed class=slnt>وْ</tajweed>لَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ـٰٓ</tajweed>ئِكَ أَصْحَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>بُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed><tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َارِ‌ۖ هُمْ فِيهَا خَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لِد<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٩</span>","End":"٣٩","PageNumber":7,"JuzNumber":1,"ManzilNumber":1,"RukuNumber":5,"MaqraNumber":2,"HizbNumber":1,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":2,"SurahIndex":"002","VerseNumber":40,"ShowSurahName":false,"