ageNumber":7,"JuzNumber":1,"ManzilNumber":1,"RukuNumber":6,"MaqraNumber":2,"HizbNumber":1,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":2,"SurahIndex":"002","VerseNumber":42,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَلَا تَلۡبِسُواْ ٱلۡحَقَّ بِٱلۡبَٰطِلِ وَتَكۡتُمُواْ ٱلۡحَقَّ وَأَنتُمۡ تَعۡلَمُونَ","TajweedText":"وَلَا تَلْبِسُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحَقَّ بِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْبَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>طِلِ وَتَكْتُمُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحَقَّ وَأَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>ُمْ تَعْلَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٢</span>","End":"٤٢","PageNumber":7,"JuzNumber":1,"ManzilNumber":1,"RukuNumber":6,"MaqraNumber":2,"HizbNumber":1,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":2,"SurahIndex":"002","VerseNumber":43,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَأَقِيمُواْ ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ وَءَاتُواْ ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ وَٱرۡكَعُواْ مَعَ ٱلرَّـٰكِعِينَ","TajweedText":"وَأَقِيمُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>صَّلَ<tajweed class=slnt>و</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_normal>ٲ</tajweed>ةَ وَءَاتُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>زَّكَ<tajweed class=slnt>و</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_normal>ٲ</tajweed>ةَ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>رْكَعُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> مَعَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>رّ<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>كِع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٣</span>","End":"٤٣","PageNumber":7,"JuzNumber":1,"ManzilNumber":1,"RukuNumber":6,"MaqraNumber":2,"HizbNumber":1,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":2,"SurahIndex":"002","VerseNumber":44,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"۞أَتَأۡمُرُونَ ٱلنَّاس